{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 169195, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 112328, "uid": 87565, "type": 4, "title": "看广告攻略", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1665726733, "updated_at": 1700229292, "updated_uid": 87565, "comment_at": 1685100344, "last_at": 1700229292, "comment_count": 15, "status": 1, "summary": "前言游戏都快良心死了，（氪金皮骗氪除外）看广告送那点东西对于官方来说其实没啥的，主要是帮金总的公司增加的小收入。如何看广告1、目前能看广告的地方有：①常驻1天3次天子召唤间隔2小时②RD门票1天5次每", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/431685.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 7, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 15901, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 1, "audit_uid": 448923, "favorite_count": 4, "seo": "{\"title\":\"\",\"desc\":\"\",\"key\":\"\"}", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 169195, "content": "<div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\">前言</span></span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;游戏都快良心死了，（氪金皮骗氪除外）看广告送那点东西对于官方来说其实没啥的，主要是帮金总的公司增加的小收入。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">如何看广告</span></div></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1、目前能看广告的地方有：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;①常驻1天3次天子召唤间隔2小时</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;②RD门票<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">1天5次每次3张间隔一个小时</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;③WB门票1天5次每次3张间隔1个小时</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;④最近新活动1天2次间隔6小时</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">2、看广告需要魔法或者加速器，不然会提示现在没有广告可以看。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">3、广告是Google提供的，看广告异常试试打开google商店试试呢。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">4、广告是视频，也可能是小游戏，需要时间加载所以魔法网速不够快，并不是你刚上魔法就能看的。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">5、开了魔法也看不了，排查是不是魔法的问题能不能上外网网站。实在不行试<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">过</span>重启游戏了么？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">6、手机支持分屏或小窗口悬浮功能的可以试试用这个方法看广告，一边打开DC打开Google商店，有一定几率跳过直接领取奖励。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">7、计时广告在计时旁边有个×，广告出错不播放不计时，可以先点击×退出然后等一会广告加载好了，再看。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">8、下方读进度条类广告可能会卡主，可以通过点击广告进google商店再返回，但可能重复操作好几次，这种广告点击广告上静音键超大概率会卡住。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">9、模拟器上看广告偶尔有奇效，基本不会卡广告。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">10、广告是可以缓存的存够了即使不上魔法也能看，这点模拟器看广告体验比较明显。（我是台式机魔法模拟器直接能用，不需要再模拟器里开魔法）</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">11、计时30秒的广告不走秒，不显示内容但显示广告的APP的图标可试试等30秒，有可能30秒之后突然变成获得奖励。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title2\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">新活动的广告选择</span></div></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1、180钻石&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2、2000紫水晶&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;3、50000金币&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;4、180体力</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">180体2星天子挖矿=300钻+1W金币&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;180体3星天子气挖矿=150钻+1.5W金币</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">1W金币=12.6体&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1.5W金币=19体</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: initial;\">5W金币=63体（其实就是1次11连开金币箱）</span></div><div></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div>180体=14.1W金币</div><div>2000紫水晶？你是什么垃圾？</div><div></div></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">体力看着能挺赚但体力不是稀有资源，每天都是大量使用，用金币购买。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">结论就是花里胡哨还不如180钻石</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">价值换算取自《挖矿攻略》</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2340\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/431685.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/431685.jpg\" style=\"height: 650.938px; width: 300.422px;\"></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\"></span></span></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1080/h_2340/1069/87565/2022/9/14/431685.jpg"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 87565, "username": "纠结37", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avata